    "Transfer verdict not_supported: the rule is not distinguishable from a plain crop of twice the predicted box on ultrasound (+0.08 pp, CI -0.59 to 0.74, p=0.83; per seed +0.41, -0.85, +0.67). By the consequence fixed in the protocol the manuscript states that a fixed factor of about two performed like the rule on both modalities and does not present the transfer rule as an advantage in accuracy.",
    "A tight crop (1.25) gives no gain on the OOD mean and lowers the in-distribution BUSI score by 2.7 pp; factors 3.0 and 4.0 trigger a second pass on only 15% and 9% of the images and stay at the single-pass level. Only factors 1.5 to 2.0 and the rule give a gain.",
    "BUID (35 images) and UDIAT (25 images) are small and the study has three seeds; the per-set differences are noisy."
